@startuml
title Plan Object Lifecycle

participant "PlannerNode" as Planner
participant "State" as State
participant "ResearcherNode_0" as R0
participant "ResearcherNode_1" as R1
participant "ReporterNode" as Reporter

== 计划生成 ==
Planner -> State : 存储 current_plan
note right: 包含多个研究步骤\n每个步骤分配给特定节点

== 并行执行 ==
R0 -> State : 获取 current_plan
R0 -> R0 : 查找分配的步骤
R0 -> State : 更新步骤状态为 processing
R0 -> R0 : 执行研究任务
R0 -> State : 存储执行结果和完成状态

R1 -> State : 获取 current_plan
R1 -> R1 : 查找分配的步骤
R1 -> State : 更新步骤状态为 processing
R1 -> R1 : 执行研究任务
R1 -> State : 存储执行结果和完成状态

== 结果汇总 ==
Reporter -> State : 获取完整的 current_plan
Reporter -> Reporter : 汇总所有步骤的执行结果
Reporter -> State : 生成最终报告

@enduml
